# Local test and build leftovers. The Dockerfile copies whole plugin
# directories and runs `pip install -e` on each (which regenerates
# *.egg-info), so none of these belong in the image. A developer's tox
# environments alone can add over 1 GB to the build context.
**/.tox
**/.pytest_cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
**/.venv
# Cargo build output (plugins/AnnotationPlugin/bson-json-native).
**/target
